h to avoid death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/2d9f04e6d8a4f4244972a3a2b1638c4c.webp?t=1771602873\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/903a96a79be1c43fa57fac5b7a590191.poster.avif?t=1771602873\" width=674 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/903a96a79be1c43fa57fac5b7a590191.webm?t=1771602873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability! Everything is randomly generated so no two runs are the same. In some runs you will get lucky and it will be easy and in others will be brutally hard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/99bacd0e46c5b443b5e5a8f91512c7dc.webp?t=1771602873\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget get to wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/d9821d0e9da544de49c120820822ea8b.poster.avif?t=1771602873\" width=674 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/d9821d0e9da544de49c120820822ea8b.webm?t=1771602873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["SPACEGAMESstudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_ima